# The quick select's pages (Rerac-vr's hand_select_menu): the ring holds every item owned, eight a
# page, in Rerac-vr's order; the trigger turns the page and fires nothing; the right hand picks; the
# left stick keeps walking the whole time. [vr-ring] lines tell each page.
# Run with QUEST_SIM_GIVE=10,15,16,11,13,9,18,19,20,17,21,23 (13 owned with the wrench: two pages).
600 y 1
606 y 0
3200 shot before
# Open the ring and walk.
3300 right_click 1
3302 left_y 1
3340 shot page1
# The trigger: page two.
3360 right_trigger 1
3366 right_trigger 0
3400 shot page2
# The hand pushed right picks the slot there; letting go of the ring takes it.
3420 rh_x 0.17
3460 shot picked
3470 right_click 0
3480 rh_x 0
3490 left_y 0
3560 shot after
# Again, pressed a few times (Novalis's help messages hold the ring back while one shows): it opens on
# page one.
3600 right_click 1
3620 right_click 0
3650 right_click 1
3670 right_click 0
3700 right_click 1
3720 right_click 0
3750 right_click 1
3790 shot reopened
3800 right_click 0
3900 quit 0
